      "title": "Wikipedia: The Setting Sun",
      "snippet": "[Wikipedia Synopsis] The Setting Sun (斜陽, Shayō) is a Japanese novel by Osamu Dazai first published in 1947. The story centers on an aristocratic family in decline and crisis during the early years after World War II.",
